WEBVTT

00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:01.249
These elements have a huge
range of magnetic,

00:01:01.249 --> 00:01:02.201
phosphorescent,

00:01:02.201 --> 00:01:03.855
and conductive properties

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.596
that make them crucial 
to modern technologies.

00:01:06.596 --> 00:01:09.908
In fact, of the 17 types 
of rare earth metals,

00:01:09.908 --> 00:01:13.757
phones and other electronics 
may contain up to 16.

00:01:13.757 --> 00:01:17.465
In smartphones, these create the screen 
and color display,

00:01:17.465 --> 00:01:18.915
aid conductivity,

00:01:18.915 --> 00:01:21.393
and produce the signature vibrations,

00:01:21.393 --> 00:01:22.929
amongst other things.

00:01:22.929 --> 00:01:24.872
And yet, crucial as they are,

00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:26.815
extracting these elements from the earth

00:01:26.815 --> 00:01:30.660
is linked to some disturbing 
environmental impacts.